{
  "lessonId": "L1M1L2",
  "title": "義大利分級制度 (DOCG/DOC/IGT)",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover'><h1>🏆 義大利葡萄酒分級制度</h1><p class='subtitle'>DOCG · DOC · IGT · VdT 完全解析</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>📋 金字塔分級體系</h2><div class='pyramid'><div class='pyramid-level level-1'><div class='level-name'>DOCG</div><div class='level-desc'>Denominazione di Origine Controllata e Garantita</div><div class='level-count'>74 個產區 · 最高等級</div></div><div class='pyramid-level level-2'><div class='level-name'>DOC</div><div class='level-desc'>Denominazione di Origine Controllata</div><div class='level-count'>334 個產區 · 優質法定產區</div></div><div class='pyramid-level level-3'><div class='level-name'>IGT</div><div class='level-desc'>Indicazione Geografica Tipica</div><div class='level-count'>118 個產區 · 地區餐酒</div></div><div class='pyramid-level level-4'><div class='level-name'>VdT</div><div class='level-desc'>Vino da Tavola</div><div class='level-count'>日常餐酒</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📊 分級制度比較表</h2><div class='grade-comparison-table'><table><thead><tr><th>比較項目</th><th class='grade-docg'>DOCG</th><th class='grade-doc'>DOC</th><th class='grade-igt'>IGT</th><th class='grade-vdt'>VdT</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='item-label'>🏅 等級定位</td><td>最高等級<br>保證品質</td><td>優質法定產區</td><td>地區餐酒</td><td>日常餐酒</td></tr><tr><td class='item-label'>📍 產區數量</td><td><strong>74 個</strong></td><td><strong>334 個</strong></td><td><strong>118 個</strong></td><td>無限制</td></tr><tr><td class='item-label'>🔒 產區規範</td><td>極嚴格劃定</td><td>嚴格劃定</td><td>廣泛地區</td><td>無規範</td></tr><tr><td class='item-label'>🍇 葡萄品種</td><td>限定本土品種<br>與比例</td><td>限定品種<br>與比例</td><td>彈性大<br>可用國際品種</td><td>無限制</td></tr><tr><td class='item-label'>📉 產量限制</td><td>最嚴格<br>(例: 56 hl/ha)</td><td>嚴格控管</td><td>較寬鬆</td><td>無限制</td></tr><tr><td class='item-label'>⏱️ 陳年要求</td><td>嚴格規定<br>(通常數年)</td><td>有規定</td><td>無強制要求</td><td>無要求</td></tr><tr><td class='item-label'>✅ 品質檢測</td><td>化學分析 +<br>感官評鑑</td><td>需檢測</td><td>基本檢測</td><td>無檢測</td></tr><tr><td class='item-label'>🏷️ 特殊標誌</td><td>瓶頸編號封條</td><td>無</td><td>無</td><td>無</td></tr><tr><td class='item-label'>⏳ 晉升條件</td><td>須先為 DOC<br>至少 5 年</td><td>須先為 IGT<br>或有傳統</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td class='item-label'>💰 價格定位</td><td>高端精品</td><td>中高端</td><td>中端到高端<br>(超托等)</td><td>入門級</td></tr><tr><td class='item-label'>🌟 代表酒款</td><td>Barolo<br>Brunello<br>Amarone</td><td>Chianti<br>Soave<br>Barbera d'Asti</td><td>超級托斯卡納<br>Toscana IGT</td><td>日常餐酒</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>⭐ DOCG - 保證法定產區</h2><div class='highlight-box'><h3>最嚴格的品質保證</h3><ul class='big-points'><li>✓ 必須先成為 DOC 至少 5 年</li><li>✓ 瓶頸貼有官方編號封條</li><li>✓ 嚴格產量限制與品質檢測</li><li>✓ 必須通過化學分析與感官評鑑</li></ul></div><div class='examples-grid'><div class='example-card'><div class='example-icon'>👑</div><div class='example-name'>Barolo DOCG</div><div class='example-region'>Piemonte</div></div><div class='example-card'><div class='example-icon'>🌿</div><div class='example-name'>Brunello di Montalcino</div><div class='example-region'>Toscana</div></div><div class='example-card'><div class='example-icon'>🍷</div><div class='example-name'>Amarone della Valpolicella</div><div class='example-region'>Veneto</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎯 DOC - 法定產區</h2><div class='comparison-table'><table><tr><th>規範項目</th><th>要求</th></tr><tr><td>產區範圍</td><td>嚴格劃定地理界線</td></tr><tr><td>葡萄品種</td><td>限定品種與比例</td></tr><tr><td>種植方式</td><td>規定種植密度與產量</td></tr><tr><td>釀造工藝</td><td>規定釀造方法與陳年時間</td></tr><tr><td>酒精濃度</td><td>最低酒精度要求</td></tr></table></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌍 IGT - 地區餐酒</h2><div class='igt-features'><div class='feature-box'><h3>✨ 創新的空間</h3><p>允許使用國際品種（Cabernet、Merlot 等）</p><p>促成了「超級托斯卡納」的誕生</p></div><div class='feature-box success'><h3>📍 著名 IGT 範例</h3><ul><li><strong>Toscana IGT</strong> - 超級托斯卡納的家</li><li><strong>Veneto IGT</strong> - 創新白酒天堂</li><li><strong>Sicilia IGT</strong> - 高品質島嶼酒</li></ul></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>💡 如何閱讀酒標</h2><div class='label-guide'><div class='label-item'><span class='label-number'>1</span><div class='label-text'><strong>酒莊名稱</strong><br>Producer Name</div></div><div class='label-item'><span class='label-number'>2</span><div class='label-text'><strong>產區等級</strong><br>DOCG / DOC / IGT</div></div><div class='label-item'><span class='label-number'>3</span><div class='label-text'><strong>年份</strong><br>Vintage</div></div><div class='label-item'><span class='label-number'>4</span><div class='label-text'><strong>酒精濃度</strong><br>Alcohol %</div></div><div class='label-item'><span class='label-number'>5</span><div class='label-text'><strong>容量</strong><br>Volume (ml)</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點總結</h2><div class='summary-boxes'><div class='summary-box'><strong>DOCG</strong><br>最高等級，品質保證</div><div class='summary-box'><strong>DOC</strong><br>優質法定產區</div><div class='summary-box'><strong>IGT</strong><br>創新與地區特色</div><div class='summary-box'><strong>VdT</strong><br>日常餐酒</div></div></div></section></div><style>.pyramid{margin:30px auto;max-width:600px}.pyramid-level{margin:10px auto;padding:20px;text-align:center;border-radius:8px;transition:all .3s}.level-1{width:90%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd700,#ffed4e);color:#333}.level-2{width:100%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c0c0c0,#e8e8e8);color:#333}.level-3{width:100%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#cd7f32,#d4a76a);color:#fff}.level-4{width:100%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#95a5a6,#bdc3c7);color:#333}.pyramid-level:hover{transform:scale(1.02);box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}.level-name{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}.level-desc{font-size:.95rem;opacity:.9;margin-bottom:5px}.level-count{font-size:1rem;font-weight:600}.grade-comparison-table{overflow-x:auto;margin:20px 0}.grade-comparison-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.95rem;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.grade-comparison-table thead th{padding:15px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:1rem}.grade-comparison-table th:first-child{background:#2c3e50;min-width:120px}.grade-comparison-table .grade-docg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd700,#f5c842)}.grade-comparison-table .grade-doc{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c0c0c0,#d8d8d8)}.grade-comparison-table .grade-igt{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#cd7f32,#da9c5e)}.grade-comparison-table .grade-vdt{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#95a5a6,#a8b4b6)}.grade-comparison-table tbody td{padding:12px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;text-align:center;line-height:1.5;vertical-align:top}.grade-comparison-table .item-label{background:#f8f9fa;font-weight:600;text-align:left;color:#2c3e50;border-right:2px solid #ddd}.grade-comparison-table tbody tr:hover{background:#f1f3f5}.grade-comparison-table tbody tr:hover .item-label{background:#e9ecef}.grade-comparison-table td strong{color:#667eea;font-size:1.05rem}.grade-comparison-table td br{margin:2px 0}.examples-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:25px}.example-card{background:#f8f9fa;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;border-top:4px solid #667eea;transition:all .3s}.example-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.example-icon{font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:10px}.example-name{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin-bottom:5px}.example-region{color:#7f8c8d;font-size:.9rem}.comparison-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.comparison-table th{background:#667eea;color:#fff;padding:15px;text-align:left;font-size:1.1rem}.comparison-table td{padding:15px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;font-size:1.05rem}.comparison-table tr:hover{background:#f8f9fa}.igt-features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.feature-box{background:#f8f9fa;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-left:5px solid #667eea}.feature-box.success{border-left-color:#4caf50}.feature-box h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#2c3e50}.feature-box p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.6}.feature-box ul{margin:15px 0;padding-left:20px}.feature-box li{margin:8px 0;line-height:1.6}.label-guide{background:#f8f9fa;padding:30px;border-radius:12px}.label-item{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:15px;margin:10px 0;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #667eea}.label-number{width:40px;height:40px;background:#667eea;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.2rem;margin-right:20px}.label-text{flex:1}.label-text strong{display:block;font-size:1.1rem;color:#2c3e50;margin-bottom:3px}.summary-boxes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:15px}.summary-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#667eea,#764ba2);color:#fff;padding:25px 15px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(102,126,234,.3)}</style>",
  "quiz": [
    {
